adm4@po.cwru.edu (Aaron Mandelbaum) writes:

> How do you change your sex? I thought the only way to be female (at the 
> start) was to be a valkyrie.

You can set NETHACKOPTIONS to 'female' if you're playing on a unix
system, or create a file called .nethackrc containing the line

OPTIONS=female

(I also used this file to set OPTIONS=pickup_types:$!=+/?) which is
a useful feature of 3.1.3 I find.)

Of course, the other way is with an amulet of change. Once in a while I
try to play a Valkyrie called RuPaul who is determined to be the only
VM (i.e male Valkyrie) entry in the book... so far have made it to the
logfile but not the record book...

